msgid ""
"the backend switch, the units that can restart it behind your back, and "
"which model is on disk"
msgstr ""
"de backendschakelaar, de units die hem buiten je om kunnen herstarten, en "
"welk model op schijf staat"

msgid ""
"the console keymap and the xkb layout, which are separate settings that "
"sometimes disagree"
msgstr ""
"de toetsenbordindeling van de console en die van xkb, twee losse "
"instellingen die soms verschillen"

msgid ""
"the reader, which fingers are on file, and enrolling another — the lock "
